lan_reply_blocked.description:
Home Assistant's local search gets no reply from these stations on its own network, so each connection is set up through eufy's servers (video stays local) and a reconnect needs the internet and eufy's servers:

{stations}

If the Home Assistant host has a firewall, allow all UDP from these addresses, then reload the integration. This clears at the next connection over the local network; ignore it to keep connecting through eufy's servers.
